# Copy to .env for LIVE or RECORD runs. NOT needed for the default path.
#
# `make demo` runs in replay mode against committed cassettes: no API key, no
# network. That is the definition of done in architecture.md §12, and it is what
# CI exercises. You only need a key to re-record cassettes:
#
#     make demo MODE=record
#
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
